        <div class="contact-reference-info" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">Get in Touch</p><p class="contact-reference-intro">Reach out to us through any of the channels below. We're always happy to help.</p>
            <div class="contact-reference-detail"><i class="bi bi-telephone-fill"></i><div><strong>Phone</strong><span>+256 700 123456<br>+256 757 318 918</span></div></div>
