    <section class="contact-faq"><div class="container"><div class="contact-faq-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Frequently Asked Questions</p><p>Find answers to common questions about our services and how to get in touch.</p></div><a href="mailto:hello@litafrica.org">View All FAQs <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></a></div><div class="contact-faq-grid"><details><summary>How can I start a program? <i class="bi bi-plus"></i></summary><p>Send us a message and our team will help you choose the right next step.</p></details><details><summary>What payment methods do you accept? <i class="bi bi-plus"></i></summary><p>We will share the available payment options when we confirm your program.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer online training? <i class="bi bi-plus"></i></summary><p>Yes. Ask us about current online and hybrid learning options.</p></details><details><summary>Can I host my website with you? <i class="bi bi-plus"></i></summary><p>Yes. Our managed hosting team can help with setup and migration.</p></details><details><summary>How can I become a partner? <i class="bi bi-plus"></i></summary><p>Contact us with a little context about your organization and goals.</p></details><details><summary>Do you provide certificates? <i class="bi bi-plus"></i></summary><p>Certificate availability depends on the specific course or program.</p></details></div></div></section>
